# estimate-extractor runs fully offline and requires no environment
# variables or API keys for its core pipeline. This file is provided for
# forward-compatibility with optional integrations (e.g. a future OCR
# engine credential or log shipping target) and is intentionally empty
# of any required values today.

# Path to a config.yaml to use instead of the bundled config.example.yaml.
# ESTIMATE_EXTRACTOR_CONFIG=./config.yaml

# Path to the tesseract binary, if it is not on PATH (see README OCR setup).
# TESSERACT_CMD=/opt/homebrew/bin/tesseract
